00:30:57.440 --> 00:31:06.300
<v Vienna Luke>--you wrote in the email that you sexually assaulted me, [LAUGHS] which, yeah, so at what point--

00:31:06.300 --> 00:31:09.640
<v Justin>I think of taking pictures of you as sexual assault.

00:31:09.640 --> 00:31:10.280
<v Vienna Luke>OK.

00:31:10.280 --> 00:31:11.360
<v Justin>I--

00:31:11.360 --> 00:31:12.000
<v Vienna Luke>But--

00:31:12.000 --> 00:32:06.810
<v Justin>Right. I masturbated twice. And it was between that I laid down with you. And so I was on-- after you have sex, there's a window of time where you're not ready to have sex again. And so it was during that time that I was laying beside you, spooning you, but just spooning you. And so I may have been up against you. My penis may have been in around your rear end, around your legs. But it wasn't-- I've always worried that there would have been some degree of mess. And you would have thought that potentially I had raped you.

00:32:06.810 --> 00:32:14.490
