00:34:23.060 --> 00:34:45.780
<v Vienna Luke>Because I definitely came to with my shorts and underwear coming off and wondered why, if I was vomiting, I would need my underwear taken off. So yeah, I feel like you didn't just-- you didn't just stop there.

00:34:45.780 --> 00:34:54.640
<v Justin>There was no contact. You know that line that I talk about that I didn't want to cross, that I wasn't willing to cross?

00:34:54.640 --> 00:34:56.000
<v Vienna Luke>Well, but you did cross it.

00:34:56.000 --> 00:34:57.580
