00:35:32.820 --> 00:35:51.700
<v Aviva DeKornfeld>RCMP, Royal Canadian Mounted Police. Something was wrong with the transmission, and they'd missed large chunks of the conversation. So while Vienna was dutifully working through her checklist of questions, the cops upstairs were on edge. But Vienna didn't know that at the time.

00:35:51.700 --> 00:36:20.950
<v Vienna Luke>And I take the call, and I just go a couple steps away. There is a fireplace there in the restaurant, and I kind of step over closer to this fireplace. And I'm kind of like, oh, hey, what's up? And upstairs is like, have you got everything? How are you doing down there? And I'm like, I think I've got everything. But maybe I'm not going hard enough for some details. So you want me to kind of push, push in, go a little harder?

00:36:20.950 --> 00:36:23.370
