00:36:37.310 --> 00:36:39.910
<v Vienna Luke>Yeah, exactly.

00:36:39.910 --> 00:36:49.230
<v Justin>Why would I admit that I put drugs in the drink and then not admit that I had sex with you if I had?

00:36:49.230 --> 00:36:53.470
<v Vienna Luke>Because you can justify that to yourself? I don't know.

00:36:53.470 --> 00:36:55.730
<v Justin>So in my--

00:36:55.730 --> 00:37:08.620
<v Vienna Luke>Because it makes you feel better, even though you think maybe drugs are really bad. But it's less of an evil in your mind to be like, oh, just drugs, but rape is like-- you know?

00:37:08.620 --> 00:37:18.630
<v Justin>I wanted you to not even know that anything had happened. Does that make sense?

00:37:18.630 --> 00:37:19.130
<v Vienna Luke>No, say--

00:37:18.990 --> 00:37:28.510
<v Justin>Can you understand that I would walk into that and hope that I could take pictures of you, go through the evening, and have you wake up the next day, and never know that any of it happened?

00:37:28.510 --> 00:37:31.190
<v Vienna Luke>Oh, of course, you'd want that.

00:37:31.190 --> 00:37:41.110
<v Justin>V, when I look at the future, when I look at your family and my family and your parents and all of that, that's all that's at stake here right now.

00:37:41.110 --> 00:37:42.030
<v Vienna Luke>Yeah.

00:37:42.030 --> 00:37:45.270
<v Justin>Why would I not come clean on that if it wasn't?

00:37:45.270 --> 00:38:01.980
<v Vienna Luke>Well, maybe you feel like you can get it without giving that up. For me, that's what I need you-- I need you to admit to that. [LAUGHS] You're not going to.

00:38:01.980 --> 00:38:03.620
<v Justin>I can't, V. That's a lie.

00:38:03.620 --> 00:38:06.120
<v Vienna Luke>[LAUGHS]

00:38:06.120 --> 00:38:11.440
<v Justin>It really would be a lie if I told you right now that I had done that. It would be a lie.

00:38:11.440 --> 00:38:18.560
<v Aviva DeKornfeld>Vienna's made it through her whole checklist of questions. So she asked Justin one last thing before she wraps up.

00:38:18.560 --> 00:38:23.560
<v Vienna Luke>Is there anything that I'm not asking and you're not disclosing?

00:38:23.560 --> 00:38:28.580
<v Justin>No reason for me to disclose this, but I took pictures of you at other times.

00:38:28.580 --> 00:38:29.160
<v Vienna Luke>OK.

00:38:29.160 --> 00:38:34.240
<v Justin>But it wasn't with you. It was through your window.

00:38:34.240 --> 00:38:39.060
<v Aviva DeKornfeld>Justin's saying he took pictures of Vienna at other times, too, through her window.

00:38:39.060 --> 00:38:41.800
<v Vienna Luke>OK. Which window?

00:38:41.800 --> 00:38:43.520
